Package: pvn-node
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: PVN Project <root@localhost>
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, curl, liburi-perl, libwww-perl, openssl, python3, systemd, openvswitch-switch (>= 3.5~), ovn-host (>= 25.03~), ovn-central (>= 25.03~), pve-manager (>= 9.0), pve-manager (<< 10)
Description: Proxmox VE cloud networking manager backed by OVN
 Installs the PVN manager, local interface binding agent, Proxmox UI extension,
 control schema, and central-role units. The same package is required on every
 online node in a PVN-enabled Proxmox cluster.
